 "description": "<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Product Description</h2>\n<p>Experience pleasure like never before with our cutting-edge Bluetooth G-Spot Vibrator. With 10 vibration modes to choose from. you'll find the perfect rhythm to send you into ecstasy.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_2_8c6960b3-6510-4eab-bee3-4707b9164864_480x480.jpg?v=1695280265\"></p>\n<p>What sets this vibrator apart is its innovative bendable Bluetooth antenna. extending beyond the body of the toy to expand the control area. This means you can explore new heights of pleasure with seamless remote control. all at your fingertips.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_3_7d409bad-37d4-4c55-8c6d-2b3bbe1e1e54_480x480.jpg?v=1695280270\"></p>\n<p>The curved design is expertly crafted to target your erogenous zones with precision. Its strong vibrations will stimulate your entire area. ensuring you're in for a sensational experience.</p>\n<p>Featuring a three-point stimulator. this vibrator takes your pleasure to the next level. providing intense sensations that will leave you craving for more.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_4_075c3d3f-0345-4f78-93a5-7a3421166b9a_480x480.jpg?v=1695280275\"></p>\n<p>Worried about where you can use it? Don't be. Our vibrator boasts a waterproof design. allowing you to enjoy its delights in the bathroom. pool. or anywhere your desires take you. It's designed to perform flawlessly in wet environments. so you can take your pleasure to new depths.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_6_bbedba4b-60dc-4d48-999f-01dfe38d72e4_480x480.jpg?v=1695280282\"></p>\n<p>The user-friendly interface makes operation a breeze. with a fool-style interactive design. Plus. you can control it remotely with your mobile phone for added convenience.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_5_95003027-6bbb-4ce0-9c4b-3698daefd0cf_480x480.jpg?v=1695280278\"></p>\n<p>Say goodbye to constantly replacing batteries ?C our vibrator is USB rechargeable. ensuring you always have the power you need for endless enjoyment.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_10_79f21f82-e77c-48da-b4c1-f5b6e95e2fb3_480x480.jpg?v=1695280294\"></p>\n<p>Equipped with the latest Bluetooth technology. this vibrator offers the longest control range of any portable Bluetooth vibrator on the market. Explore new dimensions of pleasure and take your intimate moments to a whole new level with our Bluetooth G-Spot Vibrator.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"love egg rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/loveeggrose_7_27789574-322f-4561-a7dc-45e7352b49ad_480x480.jpg?v=1695280286\"></p>\n",
